{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:db2fac69d21465d8","name":"Model 67 Shrieker Speeder Bike","source":{"id":"source:reference-db2fac69d21465d8","title":"Model 67 Shrieker Speeder Bike","revision":20248,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:29:45Z","sha256":"24a0f037aa9b3a6a2272eaab0ad8ed8689ca342c53dc0567f4a81fc991938e40","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20248","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Model%2067%20Shrieker%20Speeder%20Bike&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-db2fac69d21465d8","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A fast, slender model of Speeder Bike that resembles those used by scouts during the time of Palpatine's Empire, the Model 67 Shrieker from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ikas-Adno"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ikas-Adno?action=edit&redlink=1"}," is lightweight and highly maneuverable. Favored by outlaws who prefer speed more than protection, the Model 67 Shrieker is named for the high-pitched whine the repulsor engines emit during operation. The Model 67 Shrieker is also one of the few ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeder Bikes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeder_Bikes"}," with an elongated seat, allowing a single passenger to ride behind the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"},". The Model 67 Shrieker employs a pair of forward directional steering vanes, allowing the bike to make hairpin turns at incredible speeds, and a variable-boost repulsorlift engine gives the bike the ability to fly at up to a height of 15 meters (10 squares) with no appreciable loss of speed or maneuverability. Furthermore, the Model 67 Shrieker uses an advanced repulsor field generation system that enables safe yet rapid changes in altitude.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Model 67 Shrieker Speeder Bike is a favorite among racers throughout the galaxy, and thanks to its low price, it is commonly seen throughout ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Outer Rim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Outer_Rim?action=edit&redlink=1"},". ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bantha Rawk"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bantha_Rawk"}," and his brood own several Model 67 Shriekers, which they use to travel across their home on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Iego"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Iego","referenceId":"reference:5f46a01b68a54d33"},". ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ikas-Adno"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ikas-Adno?action=edit&redlink=1"}," used many common parts in the design of the Model 67 Shrieker, making it easy for mechanics and outlaw techs to repair and modify the Speeder Bike.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Model 67 Shrieker Speeder Bike Statistics (CL 6)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Large ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeder"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +12; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 17 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 10), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 14; +1 Armor, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicular Combat"],"href":"https://swse.mirahe